{"id": "62630", "title": "比翼篇之双面夫君", "author": "红玦紫貅", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 7, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62630.htm", "intro": "进度：完结属性分类：穿越／玄幻／未定／轻松 \r\n\r\n他愿意倾尽所能的宠爱她，并把他唯一的温柔给予她，他爱她，并尊重她最後的抉择，而内心偷偷希冀著她能永远留在自己身边......", "base": "files/article/html/62/62630", "chapters": [{"title": "1-3", "file": "9297899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4-5", "file": "9297900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-7", "file": "9297905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8-9", "file": "9297907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10-11", "file": "9297910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12-13", "file": "9297912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "9297913.html", "available": false}]}